                      (        rogue.asm):10943         *   in the tbl are done.
                      (        rogue.asm):10944         * Init tbl entry. Saves jump address, middle value, and inits counter to -1
                      (        rogue.asm):10945         * Entry: U=jump address
                      (        rogue.asm):10946         *        D=middle value (whatever that is)
                      (        rogue.asm):10947         * Exit: X points to existing tbl entry with matching U address, or new one added.
                      (        rogue.asm):10948         *       Tbl entry has U saved at ,X; D is saved at 2,x, and 4,x is inited to $FFFF
